OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHomemade bombs part of alleged
OL,4,Aplot on Manchester's Jewish community,
OL,5,Acourt told
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the buildings they are alleged
OL,8,Fto have carried out reconnaissance at
OL,9,Fis the Heaton Park synagogue which was
OL,10,Fattacked on 2 October 2025.
OL,12,FBoth men, who had arrived in the UK by
OL,13,Fsmall boat, were arrested in
OL,14,FManchester's Northern Quarter on the
OL,15,Feve of Yom Kippur - the holiest day in
OL,16,Fthe Jewish calendar.
